Disable the webview service worker and pin the patched inline script by SHA-256.

A webview runs in a cross-origin iframe. Android's WebView will let a
ServiceWorkerClient intercept the worker script, but activation never completes
there: controllerchange does not fire, workerReady never resolves, and the
webview stays blank indefinitely. Resources are served through
shouldInterceptRequest on the Kotlin side instead, so the worker has nothing to
do here even when it does start.

The CSP update matches the patched script digest without relaxing script-src to
'unsafe-inline'. Nothing under build/ recomputes this hash (the packaged
pre/index.html is copied verbatim from source), so script-src pins the exact
base64(sha256(utf8(scriptBody))) digest of the patched inline <script>:
'sha256-el/TS/5fBUMnU8ReiHF6R2lXHp9nt5L5kVHHNXSr188='. scripts/verify-server-tree.py recomputes the inline script
digest and rejects either 'unsafe-inline' or any hash drift.

The explanatory comment sits outside the <meta> element. An earlier revision put
it between the tag name and its attributes, which breaks the element: the browser
stops parsing it as a tag and renders content="default-src 'none'; ..." as
visible text at the top of every webview, with no CSP applied at all.

diff --git a/src/vs/workbench/contrib/webview/browser/pre/index.html b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/webview/browser/pre/index.html
index 42c7c01a..3e5be9a2 100644
--- a/src/vs/workbench/contrib/webview/browser/pre/index.html
+++ b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/webview/browser/pre/index.html
@@ -4,8 +4,11 @@
 <head>
 	<meta charset="UTF-8">
 
+	<!-- script-src pins the patched inline script below by its exact SHA-256 digest
+	     because nothing in the build recomputes this value. Keep this comment
+	     outside <meta> so the browser still parses the policy element. -->
 	<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
-		content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'sha256-FFQoOVVa2tOE3uqUvirwaMNT20TZmrHcL2aaOjJ8BUo=' 'self'; frame-src 'self'; style-src 'unsafe-inline';">
+		content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'sha256-el/TS/5fBUMnU8ReiHF6R2lXHp9nt5L5kVHHNXSr188=' 'self'; frame-src 'self'; style-src 'unsafe-inline';">
 
 	<!-- Disable pinch zooming -->
 	<meta name="viewport"
@@ -33,7 +36,12 @@
